    "Commitment/Consistency": {"Explanation": "The email does not reference any prior behavior or choices of the recipient to encourage further action. There is no mention of previous interactions or commitments that would be built upon."},
    "Liking": {"Explanation": "The email does not use personalization, flattery, or build trust through familiarity. It is a straightforward sales pitch without attempting to create liking or rapport with the recipient."},
    "Social proof": {"Explanation": "The email does not reference other people's participation or endorsements to support the offer. There is no mention of customer testimonials or social proof to validate the quality of the warranty plan."}
}

